    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d425">

                <pb facs="0461" n="1195" sameAs="frus:frus1895p2/pg1195"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Señor Dupuy de Lôme to Mr. Olney.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Spanish Legation</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-06-24"><hi rendition="#italic">June 24,
                        1895</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Dear Mr. Secretary</hi>: On my return to my house I
                    find a telegram from the Spanish consul at Key West, confirming the press report
                    of the return of six of the Cubans who left Key West on the 7th instant, <pb
                        facs="0462" n="1196" xml:id="pg1196"/> the day of the <hi
                        rendition="#italic">George W. Childs</hi> expedition. The consul informs me
                    that it is said there are more concealed in the surrounding keys, and among them
                    one of the leaders, Serafin Sanchez. If they were rescued by the <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Raleigh</hi> or one of the revenue cutters, it will be a
                    good object lesson, and will tend to have such people keep the peace.</p>
                <p>Accept, etc.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">E. Depuy de Lôme.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
